        "TileImage": "$($repository c658f01b-b83e-49ab-9fe6-68239b0f659d).Image",
        "Description": "The partners are dead, and Providence is about to die for good. Diana Burnwood is about to destroy Providence by becoming its new Constant. You must eliminate Don Archibald Yates and Tamara Vidal. We have also heard about the presence of Tim Quinn and Raoul Salazar, two of the last members of Providence. This retreat pot is an opportunity that may not happen again, so don&apos;t let it slip away ... Good luck 47!",
